# Guides held back from publication. One slug per line; "#" starts a comment.
#
# This file is shared by two tools:
#   - tools/port_guides.py skips these when rendering/porting from the upstream
#     ResearchGuides repo, and validates every entry against the upstream
#     catalog (a typo here fails the port).
#   - tools/build.py skips these when publishing research-guides/ -> temp/.
#     Entries excluded upstream never land in research-guides/, so build.py
#     only warns when an entry matches no local directory.

diffindiff                       # out of alpha scope
missingdata                      # out of alpha scope
research-guide-quarto-template   # authoring template, not a publishable guide
